Package: KwLccharts
Type: Package
Title: Parametric Bootstrap Percentile Control Charts for the Kumaraswamy-Lindley Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-05
Authors@R: person(given = "Mohamad Yamen", family = "Al-Mohamad",
    email = "yamen@example.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Mohamad Yamen Al-Mohamad
Maintainer: Mohamad Yamen Al-Mohamad <yamen@example.edu>
Description: Density, cumulative distribution, quantile (closed form via the
    Lambert W function) and random-generation functions for the
    Kumaraswamy-Lindley (KwL) distribution, together with maximum-likelihood
    fitting and a parametric bootstrap percentile control chart (Phase I
    control limits and Phase II / average-run-length simulation), following
    the methodology of Al-Lami, Jabbari Khamnei and Heydari (2025) for the
    Lindley-Geometric distribution, <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0316449>,
    adapted here to the three-parameter Kumaraswamy-Lindley family obtained
    from the Kumaraswamy-G construction of Cordeiro and de Castro (2011).
